menu "Xiaozhi foundation"

config SMART_ROOM_XIAOZHI_FIRST_BOOT_ACTIVATION
    bool "Enable Xiaozhi first-boot activation flow"
    default y
    help
        Read the managed Xiaozhi get_info activation response before starting
        the WebSocket session. When the backend requests activation, keep the
        product running, publish a bounded copied activation snapshot, and
        retry from the voice lifecycle task. Disable only to retain the
        pre-activation session behavior for compatibility testing.

endmenu
